tric_id\": \"dw_2896\", \"name\": \"Two-Supervisee Supervisor Records with 5-Row Windowed Average Square Footage Above 200 per Facility Organization\", \"category\": \"Facility Space Analysis\", \"desc\": \"For each facility organization, show the research volume, department names, square footage, MIT ID, and the average square footage in a window of 2 preceding and 2 following rows (grouped by facility organization key and ordered by research volume) for space supervisor usage records where the number of supervisees is 2, and only include those records where the average square footage in the window is greater than 200. Do not return any rounded answers.\"}]}"
